AIUTD TUTORIAL
title end

comment start
Written by aiutd docs from the feature files whose tests pass. Do not edit by hand.
comment end

section start
title start
Backspace
title end

paragraph start
Backspace in the write layer takes back the character before the point.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Keys: space f, backspace
paragraph end

section end

section start
title start
Select, copy and paste
title end

paragraph start
Space v starts a selection, s extends it, space y copies, escape leaves the layer, space p pastes at the cursor.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Keys: space v, space y, space p
paragraph end

section end

section start
title start
Several cursors
title end

paragraph start
Space c opens the cursor layer, down adds a cursor on the next line, f opens the write layer and typing applies to every cursor.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Keys: space c, down, f
paragraph end

section end

section start
title start
Writing and saving
title end

paragraph start
Space f opens the write layer, typing adds text, escape leaves it, space s saves the file.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Keys: space f, escape, space s
paragraph end

section end

section start
title start
Focus mode off
title end

paragraph start
A second space z brings the bar, the tabs and the mode line back.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Keys: space z, space z
paragraph end

section end

section start
title start
Moving between blocks
title end

paragraph start
Press t to go to the next block of the page.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Keys: t
paragraph end

section end

section start
title start
Undo layer
title end

paragraph start
Space u opens the undo layer, h steps back to an older saved version, k keeps it as the file.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Keys: space u, h, k
paragraph end

section end

section start
title start
Write layer tab keys
title end

paragraph start
In the write layer tab s saves the file and tab tab goes back to the visual layer.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Keys: space f, tab s, tab tab
paragraph end

section end

